# Reference Point — Main Feature Canvas Headline (`h4` in `.cert-feature-head`)

When the user says **"reference point"** for a main-feature canvas title (e.g. "Certification Interpretation"), match plain `h4` inside `header.cert-feature-head` in a scaled feature block (`.cert-feature`, `.to-feature`, `.vault-feature`).

## Structure

```html
<header class="cert-feature-head">
  <p class="eyebrow">Main Feature</p>
  <h4>Certification Interpretation</h4>
</header>
```

Use a plain `h4` — no `.title`, `.display`, or extra classes.

Pair with brown `.eyebrow` label above (same as main section eyebrows: `var(--label-size)`, weight 600, `0.2em` tracking, `var(--label)`).

## Visual spec

| Property | Value |
|----------|-------|
| Element | `h4` (no class) inside `.cert-feature-head` |
| Font | `var(--serif)` (Instrument Serif) |
| Size | `32px` |
| Weight | `400` |
| Style | **italic** |
| Color | `var(--ink-deep)` |
| Line-height | `1.15` |
| Margin | `0` |
| White-space | `nowrap` |

## Head wrapper

| Property | Value |
|----------|-------|
| Wrapper | `.cert-feature-head` |
| Layout | column flex, centered, `gap: 8px` |
| Position | absolute in scaled canvas (`1240×` Figma artboard) |

## vs other headlines

| Class / element | Use |
|-----------------|-----|
| `h4` in `.cert-feature-head` | Main feature canvas title — italic serif, **`32px`** |
| `h4` in `.disc-card-head` | Feature card title — italic serif, **`24px`** |
| `h3` in `.gap-card` | Gap punchline — italic, `--h3`, `var(--ink)` |
| `h3.title` in `.overview-sub-head` | Subsection head — regular (not italic), `--title-sm` |
| `.display` | Page section heads — largest, `--display` |

## Do not

- Use `.display` on canvas feature heads — reserve for page-level section headers.
- Match `.disc-card-head h4` (`24px`) — canvas main-feature heads are larger.
- Use sans-serif or remove italic.
